WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Step 1: In WebinarGeek open Account, then Integrations, then API in the left menu.

2
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Step 2: Copy the key with the copy icon. There is one key for the whole account.

3
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Step 3: Never click Generate API key: it switches off the key your other tools already use.

4
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Step 4: Open the webinar you created. Its ID is the number after /webinars/ in the address bar.

5
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Step 5: In your centre, paste the key into WebinarGeek API key.

6
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:43.000
Step 6: Paste the webinar's number into Webinar ID.

7
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:49.000
Step 7: Click Connect WebinarGeek. The agent reads the webinar back to check both.
